  "details": "Hi. my vrchat is gumlin-3 and id like to say a complaint about the contact sizing. my main question about it is. why is there even a size limit on them? i work on larger characters built for RPs and events. id like to ask why can i not make a contact as big or small as i want? why am i stuck at 3 meters and why do they not size down with my avatar?\n\nid like to not have to bring in 4000+ contact senders or receivers just to make a 80M tall titan be able to use one of his abilities properly. id also like to know why no one talks about this issue and id like to either have a fix when Unity 6 becomes mandatory. or when ever is able. \n\n-sincerely Gumlin-3.",
